# 400-line file limit

No tracked source file (`.py`, `.kt`, `.kts`, `.xml`, `.yml`, `.md`, `.sh`) may exceed **400 lines**.
Split by responsibility (new module/composable file) before crossing the limit.
Check with `python scripts/check_loc.py`; CI and `tests/test_loc_limit.py` enforce it.
